The projection expressions used in a configuration are too constrained: they only allow alpha-numeric and underscore characters within path segments. 

{code}
(\w+):(/([a-zA-Z_0-9]/{0,1})+)\s*=>\s*([/a-zA-Z_0-9]+)
{code}

This is too restrictive.

